# Sample MCP Tools/List Request

File: ooda/mcp/examples/tools_list_request.oot

## Request

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "method": "tools/list"
}
```

## Expected Response (abbreviated)

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "result": {
    "tools": [
      {"name": "ooda.northstar", "description": "Read the project's vision", "inputSchema": {...}},
      {"name": "ooda.rules", "description": "Read the 23 laws", "inputSchema": {...}},
      {"name": "ooda.audit", "description": "Run a Red Team gate", "inputSchema": {...}}
    ]
  }
}
```

23 tools total: 5 original + 18 blue-ocean Tiers 1-4.
